  idCMS: CMS/Configs/MultText2
  Components:
  - rid: 6341373060195811397
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 6341373060195811397
      type: {class: MulticTag, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        lines:
        - text:
            en: Khem, khem, hi ME!
            ru: "\u041A\u0445\u0435\u043C, \u043A\u0445\u0435\u043C, \u043F\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0435\u0442
              \u042F!"
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 933122c31bd0ab04cac517a4de2e9bd1, type: 3}
        - text:
            en: This is the second entry!
            ru: "\u042D\u0442\u043E \u0432\u0442\u043E\u0440\u0430\u044F \u0437\u0430\u043F\u0438\u0441\u044C!"
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 78df19d092639894fa2583e9c834f92b, type: 3}
        - text:
            en: We might have an obvious question...
            ru: "\u0423 \u043D\u0430\u0441 \u043C\u043E\u0433 \u0432\u043E\u0437\u043D\u0438\u043A\u043D\u0443\u0442\u044C
              \u043E\u0447\u0435\u0432\u0438\u0434\u043D\u044B\u0439 \u0432\u043E\u043F\u0440\u043E\u0441..."
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3a7d64eef3a0d9741a545de6fbd63906, type: 3}
        - text:
            en: And where does the energy from this machine go?
            ru: "\u0410 \u043A\u0443\u0434\u0430 \u0438\u0434\u0451\u0442 \u044D\u043D\u0435\u0440\u0433\u0438\u044F
              \u0441 \u044D\u0442\u043E\u0439 \u043C\u0430\u0448\u0438\u043D\u044B?"
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1da08fbdd7415dd4ba4369dea13d46b9, type: 3}
        - text:
            en: I can say for sure...
            ru: "\u042F \u043C\u043E\u0433\u0443 \u0441\u043A\u0430\u0437\u0430\u0442\u044C
              \u043D\u0430\u0432\u0435\u0440\u043D\u044F\u043A\u0430..."
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2d43f1f057c939d49b9e06012afe4cc2, type: 3}
        - text:
            en: That energy goes straight to our brain
            ru: "\u0427\u0442\u043E \u044D\u043D\u0435\u0440\u0433\u0438\u044F \u0438\u0434\u0451\u0442
              \u043F\u0440\u044F\u043C\u043E \u0432 \u043D\u0430\u0448 \u043C\u043E\u0437\u0433"
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: eb4fa7143bd749742a7168b811ccbb21, type: 3}
        - text:
            en: So that under stimulation you don't remember that...
            ru: "\u0427\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B \u043F\u043E\u0434 \u0441\u0442\u0438\u043C\u0443\u043B\u044F\u0446\u0438\u0435\u0439
              \u043D\u0435 \u0432\u0441\u043F\u043E\u043C\u0438\u043D\u0430\u0442\u044C
              \u043E \u0442\u043E\u043C, \u0447\u0442\u043E..."
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 24be7651fc2b85d47ac03fb1659f5890, type: 3}
        - text:
            en: You
            ru: "\u0422\u044B..."
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f81528bb70749114d98fe1c5fba1c6a6, type: 3}
        - text:
            en: ...
            ru: ...
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3e706cc0ce6aa084bbb70344c2cd9e46, type: 3}
